MENU ITEMS & DESCRIPTIONS
-------------------------------------------

SOUTH INDIAN SECTION  
• Masala Dosa — A thin crispy crepe made from fermented rice batter filled with mildly spiced potato masala. Served with coconut chutney and aromatic sambar.  
• Ghee Roast — A long, cone-shaped dosa roasted with ghee for rich flavor and crispiness.  
• Paneer Uttapam — A thick uttapam topped with marinated paneer cubes, onions, tomatoes, and green chilies.  
• Idli Sambar — Steamed fluffy idlis served with hot, freshly prepared sambar.

NORTH INDIAN SECTION  
• Butter Chicken — Tender chicken pieces simmered in a creamy tomato-based gravy with butter, cashews, and aromatic spices.  
• Paneer Tikka Masala — Char-grilled paneer cubes cooked in an onion-tomato gravy with a smoky flavor.  
• Dal Tadka — Yellow lentils tempered with ghee, garlic, cumin, and red chili.  
• Veg Biryani — Long-grain basmati rice cooked with vegetables and whole spices; served with raita.

INDO-CHINESE SECTION  
• Veg Fried Rice — Jasmine rice stir-fried with fresh vegetables, soy sauce, and light seasoning.  
• Chilli Paneer — Paneer cubes tossed with capsicum, onions, and chili sauce.  
• Hakka Noodles — Stir-fried noodles with vegetables, garlic, and a mild seasoning blend.  
• Manchow Soup — Spicy vegetable soup topped with crispy fried noodles.

Customization options:  
• Spice levels: Mild, Medium, Spicy, Extra Spicy  
• Jain modifications available for most dishes  
• Vegan customization possible for rice, noodles, and soups  


