CUSTOMER FAQ, POLICIES & SERVICE DETAILS
-------------------------------------------

FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS  
1. Do you offer home delivery?  
   Yes, delivery is available between 11 AM and 11 PM through our website, app, and phone orders.

2. Are there vegan options?  
   Yes. Options include: Veg Fried Rice, Lemon Rice, Plain Dosa (without ghee), Salads, and Vegetable Soups.  
   Paneer dishes cannot be made vegan.

3. Do you prepare Jain-style food?  
   Yes. We offer onion-free and garlic-free variants for: Paneer Butter Masala, Dal Fry, Veg Pulao, and Roti.

4. What payment methods are accepted?  
   UPI, Credit/Debit Cards, Cash, and Mobile Wallets like Paytm and PhonePe.

5. Do you accept bulk or catering orders?  
   Yes, catering available for events between 25 to 200 people.  
   Order must be placed at least 24 hours in advance.

REFUND POLICY  
• Complaints must be reported within 30 minutes of delivery.  
• Valid complaints include missing items, incorrect items, or spoiled food.  
• A replacement or refund is issued after verification.  

DELIVERY POLICY  
• Standard delivery time: 30–45 minutes.  
• Delivery is free for orders above ₹500.  
• Customers may track their orders via SMS link.  


